# Default exports for components

Export React components with `export default`. Import them as default imports.

Hooks, utilities, and constants stay as named exports in their own files under `hooks/` or `utils/` when used outside (see hooks-and-utils rule).

```tsx
// BAD
export { Button }

import { Button } from "@/components/Button/Button"

// GOOD
export default Button

import Button from "@/components/Button/Button"

// OK — non-component export next to the component when it is not a shared hook/util
export default Button
export { buttonVariants }
```
